ackOff 状态。\n\n*   **证据支撑：** 日志中的 `CONFIG_MISSING` 模式（证据 #4）与 Trace 中的 `config_missing_exit` 属性（证据 #6）及 HTTP 500 响应（证据 #4, #5）直接证实了应用内部因配置缺失而崩溃的逻辑；Metrics 中的 `Error` 终止原因（证据 #1）和 19 次重启（证据 #2）证实了这一崩溃机制的持续发生（证据 #1, #2）。\n\n**未知因素：**\n*   具体缺失的配置项名称（如具体的 ConfigMap/Secret 键名）尚未在日志或 Trace 中披露。\n*   应用镜像的默认入口执行逻辑源码未提供，无法判断为何该配置缺失会导致整体进程终止而非优雅降级。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 21.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 44.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn: 44.1s (Evidence 34.1s, RCA 9.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 78.554, "metrics": {"run_id": "271bd8163d194610", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 78.56028342247009, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, 